%N A399010 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of inequivalent ways to place k non-attacking rooks on an n X n board up to rotations of the board.
%H A399010 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A399010/b399010.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1325</a> (rows 0..50)
%e A399010 Triangle begins:
%e A399010   1;
